t-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-bc34b69da20e8c79END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2cec6b4e6d689b69END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_MurderTribunal_InvestigationPriorities</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_MurderTribunal_InvestigationPriorities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_MurderTribunal_InvestigationPriorities\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">337f4251-92a6-4adf-9dd6-23280e69d1fc</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:337f4251-92a6-4adf-9dd6-23280e69d1fc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:337f4251-92a6-4adf-9dd6-23280e69d1fc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/25px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/38px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/50px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Valeria\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/25px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\">Valeria</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Investigator Valeria\n</p><p><br>\nYour priorities for this tenday are three cases: 612, that apparent '<a href=\"/wiki/Lustrous_Lass\" title=\"Lustrous Lass\">plague ship</a>' at the broken docks; 655, the <a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\">hand-taking murderer</a>; and 657, the mortal injury to the <a href=\"/wiki/Holli_Dylford\" title=\"Holli Dylford\">waveservant</a> in the harbour, the thing that <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> is calling the 'Ol' Cholms' case.\n</p><p><br>\nOf these, 655, the <a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\">serial killer</a> is top priority, not least because the murderer's continuing activities are making us look bad. Catch the bastard.\n</p><p><br>\n- Flame Liara Portyr\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215649\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1847/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32225/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8583/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930569/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.446      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.446      1 -total\n 56.30%   23.898      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.75%   21.119     19 Template:Trim\n 21.79%    9.249      2 Template:Uid\n 15.37%    6.525      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.54%    6.173      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.63%    5.360      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.14%    4.305      2 Template:CharLink\n  9.88%    4.195      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:13578-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215649 and revision id 326832. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}